# Cursor Rules - Expense Tracker App
# Directs Cursor AI to obey master governance rules.

You are working on an offline-first Android Native app (Kotlin, Jetpack Compose Material3, Room + SQLCipher AES-256).

You MUST strictly follow and obey all operating standards defined in:
1. AGENTS.md (Root AI Governance)
2. .agents/AGENTS.md (Project Rules & Dedicated Agent Skills)
3. PROJECT_TRACKER.md (Active sprint status, max 150 lines)
4. docs/architecture/ (Subsystem modular cheatsheets)
5. docs/development/ (Development workflows & QA test playbooks)

Key Enforcements:
- STRICT NO-PUSH to remote git repositories.
- Zero network permissions (`android.permission.INTERNET` forbidden).
- Zero false positives in SMS/Notification parsing (promotions, OTPs, balance notices must be dropped).
- Word boundaries (`\b`) required on all short service matchers (`\bcred\b`, `\bcheq\b`, `\bupi\b`).
- Keep docs (PROJECT_TRACKER.md, FEATURES.md, SRS, walkthrough.md) synchronized in the exact same commit.
